      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This. While you can set it to minimal, I still strongly prefer the previous HUD for 3 main reasons:\n\n1: I do not need an entire permanent UI element on-screen to tell me when I have my menu open. I can see the menu just fine.\n\n2: The position of the HUD elements is very distracting. I'd rather them be in the bottom corners, if at all. They are not racing game elements, so they do not need to be in the upper corners where you glance at constantly. And notifications being all the way up their is less comfy to read.\n\n3: Is there no way for the HUD to auto-hide anymore? Am I constantly stuck with UI elements permanently on-screen in very distracting places?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
